      "description": "Uses count_in_box_at_least with kind='block' because this is a place/build task. The player must plant a flower (dandelion or poppy) somewhere in the garden. We check for a dandelion block appearing in a generous box around the garden area. The player starts with dandelions and poppies in inventory. We use a large box covering the entire garden interior where flowers could be planted on grass_block or farmland.",
      "rules": [
